      "id": "read_source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "role: research\nfile: E:\\Aletheia_project\\DEV_TOOLS\\ToolSet\\aletheia_toolchain\\notebook_packager_v3.1.py\n\nOpen and parse the source file, extracting every function and class definition, their signatures, docstrings, and a concise description of their internal logic and interactions.\n\nDeliverables:\n- For EVERY function and class defined in the file, skip nothing: output one entry with its name, full signature, one-line purpose, and a short description of its internal logic and how it interacts with the rest of the file.\n- A structured outline of all functions, classes, and their relationships extracted from the source.\n\nDo not summarize or omit any function or class for brevity. The deliverable is the full per-symbol breakdown, not a high-level summary.\n\n<!-- jarvis-forward-scout: do not edit below this line -->\n> **Context from `plan_root_c1fa02`:** Create a detailed specification of the script E:\\Aletheia_project\\DEV_TOOLS\\ToolSet\\aletheia_toolchain\\notebook_packager_v3.1.py that would allow a competent engineer to rebuild it from scratch.",
